  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening capacities to address emergency preparedness in Central Asia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of this workplan is to increase capacity of key stakeholders and WH site managers to prevent the loss of cultural heritage and diversity as a result of conflicts and natural disasters. Activities under this initiative will aim at strengthening capacities of WH sites&apos; managers and National Focal Points in Central Asia, promoting more holistic, multi-disciplinary approach for development of capacity-building materials and resources in emergency preparedness for cultural and natural heritage, and their integration in national and international capacity-building programmes.</narrative>
  </description>
